---
// Registers <orbit-button> and <orbit-badge>. Lives in its own .astro file (not inlined as a
// <script> tag directly in .mdx prose) because Starlight's MDX pipeline runs
// page content through the markdown/remark processor, which mangled a raw
// <script> block placed in the body — it got wrapped in a <p> and its quotes
// got smart-quoted, so the import never actually ran. .astro files don't go
// through that markdown pass, so the script survives intact here.
//
// orbit-button.js imports design-tokens' CSS itself as a side effect, which
// is enough on its own for a plain Astro page (landing) — Vite inlines it.
// But here that CSS ends up in its own chunk that Starlight's hoisted-script
// pipeline never links into the page (no <link> gets emitted for CSS pulled
// in transitively through a <script> tag). Importing it here too, directly
// in an .astro frontmatter, goes through Astro's normal CSS handling, which
// *does* reliably get linked.
import '@dragbuilder-io/design-tokens/dist/css/tokens.css';
import '@dragbuilder-io/design-tokens/dist/css/fonts.css';
---

<script>
  import '@dragbuilder-io/orbit/orbit-button.js';
  import '@dragbuilder-io/orbit/orbit-badge.js';
</script>
